{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04148","headline":"同韦舍人元旦早朝 · 徐彦伯","name":"同韦舍人元旦早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夕转清壶漏，晨惊长乐钟。\n逶迤纶禁客，假寐守铜龙。\n予亦趋三殿，肩随谒九重。\n繁珂接曙响，华劒比春容。\n相问韶光歇，弥怜芳意浓。\n愿言乘日旰，携手即云峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}